This repository publishes a paper and closed evaluation binaries for a
configuration-stable PairHMM aggregate haplotype-score reduction.

You may download and run the published binaries for evaluation and to
compare SHA-256 fingerprints against the paper. That permission does not
include source code, and it does not include any license to the LuxiEdge
engine, LuxiQuant, the Luxi Inference Engine, or any other Luxi product.

No source code is conveyed by this repository. Running a binary does not
make this software open source.

THE SOFTWARE AND BINARIES ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY
KIND.
